    title "Preserved-mask background paper normalization"
    state verified
    result pass
    method observation
    observed_at git:1ea79e4c540163f7423eba8ab087c632adfacc65
    summary """
        The source non-mask/background content includes the yellow paper cast, but the preserved-mask pipeline renders Gray8 and applies clean_gray_page before mrc_background_with_coverage; background normalization therefore pushes the paper tone toward white before dither or JP2/JPEG encoding.
        """
}

